  "_doc": "The four heroes and every move/spell. A move: anim (Chibi 2.6 clip), t [wind-up, hitting, recovery] seconds, dmg (× the hero's power), reach (m in front), depth (m up/down either side), kb (push m/s), up (launch m/s), down (knocks down), stun (s of flinch), guardBreak, hits (hits spread over the hitting time), mp (mana), move (m/s the hero slides forward while it plays). Spells add shot / aoe / self effects (js/sim/brawl.js reads every field): aoe.after = a second circle that follows, step.echo = cuts that open where each enemy stood, finish = a burst as the hitting ends, channel = keeps going while the button is held (mpPerSec, tick, r, dmg, speed = share of walk speed while spinning, min/max seconds), freeze + shatter = frozen enemies take that much more, buff.thorns = melee attackers take that × your power back. kit = dash and block upgrades by level (kind: charge | brace | parry | slip | teleport | ward | rush | wall). renamed = old spell ids in saves → new ones. Levels: hp/mp/power grow per level (perLevel).",
